# Quote — Page Layout Prototype

Interactive SLDS-native prototype for the Quote record page, from the 11 Sep 2026 stakeholder review.

Two directions on the Approval Information placement:
- **01 · In Page** — Approval Information stays as a full-width section in its current position (consolidated, shortened region labels).
- **02 · Sidebar Widget** — same content moved to a right-hand widget next to Approvals/Quote Lines/Account Details.

See `Quote Page Layout - User Stories.md` in the project for the full change log and open actions.
